AuditLogViewerComponent --> RaStore

RaRoutes ..> KpiDashboardComponent
RaRoutes ..> DeviationTrendChartComponent
RaRoutes ..> ReportGeneratorComponent
RaRoutes ..> AuditLogViewerComponent

AuditedStaffMember ..|> BaseEntity
RaApi --> AuditedStaffMemberApiEndpoint
AuditedStaffMemberApiEndpoint --|> ErrorHandlingEnabledBaseType
AuditedStaffMemberApiEndpoint --> AuditedStaffMemberAssembler
AuditedStaffMemberAssembler ..> AuditedStaffMemberResource
AuditedStaffMemberAssembler ..> AuditedStaffMember
RaStore ..> AuditedStaffMember
StaffActivity --> RaStore
