note bottom of StaffActivity
  /reports/staff-activity/:staffId: newest activity first, type filter,
  latest activity and a link back to the Laboratory staff detail.
  RA reads the staff identity through its own Laboratory ACL:
  GET /laboratories/{lab}/staff/{staffId}.
end note

note left of RaRoutes
  Source: ra/presentation/ra.routes.ts
  Public paths and guards remain unchanged.
end note

ReportApiEndpoint --|> ErrorHandlingEnabledBaseType

@enduml
